WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.855
Each section is a separate row.

00:00:02.905 --> 00:00:05.027
Open it to edit its content.

00:00:05.077 --> 00:00:11.932
Hide keeps a section available in the editor while taking it out of the published layout.

00:00:11.982 --> 00:00:15.889
Move up, Move down, and drag handles control order.

00:00:15.939 --> 00:00:19.225
Changes take effect only after you publish.
